From 1bc6dfc9e332ce329984271b087697f561860afd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hades <15710513+hadesdevls@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 23:04:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] settings, dvbridge: the transport is "As composed", not "As
 certified players"

The value of videoscreen.hadesdvtransport, its help and the kodi.log lines
said that the composer's picture goes out as certified players send it.
What is known about licensed players (Amlogic's driver, YBLOD's captures, a
published comparison of a MediaTek and two Amlogic players) says that they
send IPT-PQ-c2 for profiles 7 and 8, while Hades sends the composer's YCbCr,
which clause 6 of ETSI GS CCM 001 allows. The texts now say "As composed"
and "as clause 6 of that specification describes" (Spanish: "Tal como se
compone"). Nothing that is sent changes; the setting keeps its values.
